              <div class="kdm-faq-accordion">

                <!-- Q1: How fast will I see results? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item active">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.1. How fast will I see #1 Google rankings &amp; organic traffic
                      growth?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> SEO is a compounding long-term
                      growth process. Initial technical improvements and indexing occur in Month 1–2. Most businesses
                      start seeing noticeable keyword ranking movements and Google Page 1 traction in <strong>3 to 4
                        months</strong>, with substantial traffic and qualified lead compounding occurring between
                      Months 6 to 12.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q2: Do you guarantee #1 ranking on Google? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.2. Do you guarantee #1 ranking on Google?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> No ethical SEO agency can guarantee
                      an absolute #1 position because Google's algorithm evaluates hundreds of dynamic variables.
                      However, we guarantee <strong>100% White-Hat execution</strong>, algorithm compliance, and a
                      target <strong>60%+ to 80%+ Page 1 ranking success rate</strong> for your target keywords within 4
                      to 6 months.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q3: What deliverables are included in monthly SEO packages? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.3. What exactly is included in your monthly SEO packages?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Every SEO package includes
                      comprehensive end-to-end services: <strong>Technical SEO audits &amp; speed optimization</strong>,
                      <strong>On-Page content &amp; schema optimization</strong>, <strong>High DA White-Hat backlink
                        outreach</strong>, <strong>Google Business Profile (GMB) Local SEO</strong>, and <strong>monthly
                        ROI &amp; keyword rank reports</strong>.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q4: Is there a long-term contract or lock-in period? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.4. Is there a long-term lock-in contract? Can I pause or
                      cancel?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> We offer flexible monthly SEO
                      plans. While we recommend a minimum 4-month campaign duration to achieve peak Page 1 ranking
                      traction, <strong>there are no forced long-term lock-in contracts</strong>. You have complete
                      freedom to upgrade, pause, or adjust your monthly plan anytime based on your business needs.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q5: How do you measure and report campaign progress & ROI? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.5. How do you measure and report campaign progress and ROI?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Transparency is our top priority.
                      We provide detailed <strong>monthly PDF &amp; live reporting</strong> covering target keyword rank
                      improvements, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) organic traffic growth, Google Search Console click-through
                      rates (CTR), and direct lead/conversion metrics.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q6: Are your SEO techniques 100% White-Hat and penalty-safe? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.6. Are your SEO techniques 100% White-Hat and penalty-safe?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Yes, 100%. We strictly adhere to
                      <strong>Google Search Essentials &amp; Webmaster Guidelines</strong>. We never use PBNs, automated
                      spam links, or Black-Hat tricks. Our organic strategies focus on quality content, technical
                      excellence, and genuine high-authority editorial outreach that protects your site from core update
                      penalties.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Q7: What is the difference between Local SEO, E-commerce SEO & National SEO? -->
                <div class="kdm-faq-item">
                  <button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
                    <span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.7. How do I choose between Local SEO, E-commerce, or National SEO
                      packages?</span>
                    <span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
                  </button>
                  <div class="kdm-faq-body">
                    <p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> <strong>Local SEO</strong> is
                      designed for local businesses wanting customers in specific cities/areas (GMB 3-Pack).
                      <strong>National SEO</strong> targets competitive keywords across the entire country.
                      <strong>E-commerce SEO</strong> focuses on category &amp; product page rankings, schema markup,
                      and online sales optimization.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

